  //   anyway (LINES_PARAM, APPLE_PLATFORM) because naming the pattern is worth
  //   more than the allocation is. Safe in all 7: none carries /g, so no
  //   hoisted literal acquires a shared `lastIndex`. Checked before hoisting;
