  //   test at every one of the 11 -- exportdoc.test.ts's "densifies an ABSENT
  //   meta", and `delete (window as {...}).__OTTO_COV__` in six covapp files,
  //   where an assignment would leave `"__OTTO_COV__" in window` true and the
