  //
  // KEPT, SCOPED + FIXED -- performance/noNamespaceImport (5 -> 0). Four are
  //   `import * as dataModule from "../data"` in tests, which is not a style
  //   choice: `vi.spyOn(dataModule, fn)` needs the namespace OBJECT, and
  //   nothing tree-shakes a test. Scoped off there. The fifth was in shipped
