  //   shaken echarts core" and then did `import * as echartsCore` and
  //   `export const echarts = echartsCore`, re-exporting the entire
  //   echarts/core namespace and making every export on it reachable -- the
  //   opposite of the comment's claim. Now `import { connect, init, use }`
