  //   functions, and the object shape is preserved because seven test files
  //   vi.mock this module as `{ echarts: { init, connect } }`. Measured, not
  //   argued: built both ways, the monitor bundle goes 2,110,869 -> 2,098,052
  //   bytes, so the namespace re-export was retaining 12,817 bytes of
  //   echarts/core that nothing in this app calls.
  //
  // KEPT, RETUNED -- complexity/useMaxParams, max 5 (4 -> 1 annotation).
  //   Three of the four sit at exactly 5, one over the default, and in all
  //   three the fifth parameter is an accumulator or optional accessor rather
  //   than another datum (`warnings: string[]` in data/topology.ts's
  //   buildTunnelEdges and `endTimestamp?: (rec) => ...` in data/exportDoc.ts's
  //   dropInvalidTimestamps -- a house idiom, see normalizeSession). 5 admits
